# working docs that map the auth surface and its known gaps. this repo is
# public: PORTAL_CONTEXT.md is a full threat model of /ops and the client-id
# login, and ARC_FIX_CHECKLIST.md enumerates what is unfixed. neither holds a
# credential, and both are exactly what you would want if you were probing the
# console. keep them local, or move them somewhere private — do not commit them
# here without deciding to.
